"另外让所有 Key 的 7 天用量百分比保持接近：新会话选“默认”时放到百分比最低的 Key；某个 Key 比最低的高出 5 个百分点以上时，在一轮结束后把它的一个会话换到最低的那个（同一会话 30 分钟内最多换一次": "Also keeps the keys' 7-day usage percentages close: new sessions with “Default” go to the key with the lowest percentage; when a key is 5 or more points above the lowest one, after a turn one of its sessions moves to the lowest (a session moves at most once in 30 minutes",
